# cage_prisoner (kenshi-k16.6.36; docs/reference/SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "cage="). A prisoner of the player's squad sits in the Heft slave shop's cage (the char's
# `cage=near` key: the nearest free cage within 80 u, put in through Simulation::imprison) with a Slaver boss and three guards 40 u from it and the Wanderer
# between them. The Hub has no cage building; this is the nearest the world has to a walk-up one that the navmesh bake covers.
# Only the player is ever ordered: the slavers are not hostile to the Wanderer, so the playtester starts the fight by attacking the Slaver boss
# (ksim_cage_scenario does the same).
KSCEN 2
